  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 9050312704
    m_Localized: You can dash kick the enemy by Click [Melee] when near the Stunted
      enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 117997359104
    m_Localized: When you run out of ammo. Press [Change Weapon] to switch weapons
      if you have weapons to change.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 129674301440
    m_Localized: Right now there is only 1 difficulty in the Early Access version.
      The Hard Difficulty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137249214464
    m_Localized: If you encountered any bug please contact the game developer by
      the community as soon as possible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 121729306269372416
    m_Localized: You can regain some ammo from dead enemy for the unequipped weapon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 121729808885403648
    m_Localized: You can buy Health Potion from the shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 121730255268401152
    m_Localized: Some enemies need to be parried before damaging them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 121730797604491264
    m_Localized: To fight with stronger enemies. You need to change a weapon for
      a new better one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 121736885498335232
    m_Localized: Next Tip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 122938979483963392
    m_Localized: Limited Ammo Weapon
